ings and multiple ways to play.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015620/extras/caf8a8f417443ff862a79307d552a82f.poster.avif?t=1745504787\" width=650 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015620/extras/caf8a8f417443ff862a79307d552a82f.webm?t=1745504787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fair Warning: the game can become very hard if you get too greedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015620/extras/fc4d1d5d42ccbb89b0842402f49a2064.webp?t=1745504787\" width=650 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains 5 chapters represented by the 5 stages of DEFCON:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFCON 5\u00a0 -</strong> the initial stage of the outbreak, the first contact of the strike team with the quarantine city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFCON 4 -</strong> things spice up, new types of infected appear, maps become bigger, and event pools refresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFCON 3 -</strong> here there will be all Bosses encounters. Think outside the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFCON 2 -</strong> all you learned so far and more, maps become bigger, all stakes are amplified, and difficulty is  increased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFCON 1 -</strong> all choices you made so far in the game since the beginning will now have a direct impact on the gameplay and on the ending cutscene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each difficulty setting has its unique layout in how many days each DEFCON has.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015620/extras/ef5b1074b6119305309f857634e421e0.webp?t=1745504787\" width=650 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a Lovecraftian - Military theme, mixing Real-time strategy gameplay with heavy Horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015620/extras/265225c717988e94b76b95ca6e708364.avif?t=1745504787\" width=650 height=429 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Good luck Commander!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
